    "parts": {
      "when": "[Your Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase) or [either player's Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase).",
      "target": "An **AGENTS OF THE IMPERIUM** unit of yours that has not yet been **selected to fight** or **selected to shoot** in this phase.",
      "effect": "Attacks by the unit's models re-roll 1s to [Wound](vsdata:core-rule/wound-rolls) against a **CHARACTER** unit for the rest of the phase. If an **OFFICIO ASSASSINORUM** model makes such an attack against the enemy **WARLORD**, it can re-roll its Wound roll instead."
